// Sump-slick action — a jury-rigged fast action: scales the reload cost down (a faster, if
// smaller, speed-up than a dedicated speed-loader). GTW-549 data-driven attachment ITEM (the
// grimdark "SumpSlickAction" tag). The magnitude lives HERE on the item (GTW-542 read a
// GLOBAL tuning factor — the exact defect this rework fixes). Applied post-spawn. (The GTW-542
// tag also added base spread; that sloppier-cone coupling is USER-REVIEW — the shipped default
// is the reload speed-up alone.)
(
    display_name: "Sump-Slick Action",
    effects: [
        FastReload(0.7),  // ×0.7 the weapon's reload_tu (< 1 = faster) — tunable
    ],
)
